d22ba", "message": "Implement Float#truncated.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T14:37:17Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2693ce869ea55e378c2c00fb8a0bae6594acfa17", "message": "Force Float and a few other core classes to be initialized before user classes. This may not end the ordering problems, but it is a 3-line hack and it gets us through the present pass.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T14:36:38Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ea523432a7019de7355104ca5beaa9c23dc9d303", "message": "Fix primitive Object#perform:withArguments:inSuperclass.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T05:32:24Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "43cf1edadf602a522ac2fa07525d24660ca62115", "message": "Add LargePositiveInteger and LargeNegativeInteger to handmade-test.st. Implement primitive SmallInteger#bitShift:.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T03:46:57Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a5aa720044b56ae823c463c3db85ff98801c3783", "message": "Enable integer tests, comment out the ones that fail.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T00:41:08Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2390339918f57ab5d5cecb97912bb0b6037ff3d0", "message": "Fix \"0 bitXor: 0\" so it doesn't infinitely recurse; generally fix the bitOp primitives to succeed when they can. Fix primitive SmallInteger#asFloat. Implement primitive LargePositiveInteger#digitLength. Fix a few bugs where we were passing JS strings rather than Smalltalk String objects to Object#error:.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T00:34:51Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ecabf677200623ee180854d59200d79dfa5f35f9", "message": "Minor rewording of previous commit.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T00:27:42Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f6f7612ffabb363e844ecc34c630c587722810d3", "message": "Fix two bugs: treat ES5 FutureReservedWords and arguments as reserved; make super work in blocks.", "created_at": "2011-11-30T00:25:11Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "adca716550cac8c21b10998aafede2d5c7ab30c5", "message": "Add a small test.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T20:33:09Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "422e16ba8b7630231420854cbc36a0130d9fac48", "message": "Add code to bootstrap Symbol#SingleCharSymbols. Permit String#at:put: with SmallInteger second argument. Change Object#error to be a bit more likely to produce a nice JS exception.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T20:12:08Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4529e6e882b6082165ef43426b9cd7a0ec4118b8", "message": "Name some functions.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T19:50:06Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95fc804d615cf39c1b774b9df761989f966337ee", "message": "Implement String#at:put: and fix Behavior#new and Behavior#new_ for Strings and Symbols.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T19:43:31Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cf1909fa24717d7175a5055fc3ffcd4b4659cf46", "message": "Since Squeak ByteArrays are backed by JS Uint8Arrays, Object#basicAt: and basicAt:put: must special-case them. This is ugly and could be implemented a different way, later, as an optimization.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T19:06:40Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "542a8b3d67d217868e3ce724b801eee42d563d9f", "message": "Fix typo computing size of a String.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T16:56:28Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b85dc53c5e2916ab3948072272e2b16ab8ffa51", "message": "Fix JS operator precedence botch in emitter.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T16:50:51Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "677f996073c944e0c9833d12fd8393558ad86940", "message": "Fix silly bug in Symbol().", "created_at": "2011-11-29T16:45:43Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "59b52dac827227ce1a276b557aa452e0a8feb1bd", "message": "Switch to strict mode. Fix several bugs found by strict mode. Delete a redundant classes[name] assignment in defClass.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T15:55:45Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7b24b06192a24e9b7ba864099146c451193a90ef", "message": "New script js/main.js to run the compiler from the shell.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T05:33:58Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7f1c7fb9e23cff4cd26dc0b014023a2e6e51c424", "message": "initial check-in of js files", "created_at": "2011-11-29T04:50:28Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff95df3a0719cf0f0f192b3cd90860b760a3d1e3", "message": "build.py: Speak up if ScratchSources.st does not exist. Change file extension from .txt to .st in comment.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T04:36:11Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0828e0b444f0bf8869659d69344d4d5a044f2e79", "message": "Add long comment to build.py about extracting smalltalk sources.", "created_at": "2011-11-29T04:09:14Z", "repo": "webscratch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "408bb52d52778f96163fb7c57b3b90fbfd46b81e", "messag